## https://github.com/MitMaro/git-interactive-rebase-tool#common-default-key-bindings
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (All) Show help                                          | ?
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Move selection up/down                     | Up
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Move selection up/down five lines          | PgUp/PgDn
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Move selection to start/end of list        | Home/End
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Abort interactive rebase                   | q
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Immediately abort interactive rebase       | Q
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Write interactive rebase file              | w
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Immediately write interactive rebase file  | W
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Move selected commit(s) down/up            | j/k
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal) Toggle break action                             | b
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Set selected commit(s) to be picked        | p
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Set selected commit(s) to be reworded      | r
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Set selected commit(s) to be edited        | e
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Set selected commit(s) to be squashed      | s
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Set selected commit(s) to be fixed-up      | f
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal) Set selected commit(s) to be dropped            | d
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Diff) Show full commit diff                             | d
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal) Edit the command of an editable action          | E
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Enter and exit visual mode (for selection) | v
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal) Insert a new line                               | I
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal) Duplicate the selected line                     | C-d
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Remove selected lines                      | Del
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Open todo file in external editor          | !
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Undo the previous change                   | C-z
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Redo the previously undone change          | C-y
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Normal/Diff) Show commit information                    | c
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Diff) Scroll view down/up                               | Down/Up
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Diff) Scroll view left/right                            | Lt/Rt
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Diff) Scroll view to the top/end                        | Home/End
Git Interactive Rebase Tool: (Diff) Scroll view a step up/down                        | PgUp/PgDn